Rule 2 (If out is provided, its dtype must be floating point or complex)
{out : tensor} |= (dtype_(out) = 6) ∨ (dtype_(out) = 7) ∨ (dtype_(out) = 8) ∨ (dtype_(out) = 9) ∨ (dtype_(out) = 10)
